    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm working on a brief for a board of directors for a mid-sized manufacturing company. they're pretty old-school and skeptical about all this ESG stuff. they think it's just a distraction from making money. \n\ncan you write a summary for them that explains why integrating ESG into our core strategy is actually a smart move for long-term stability? basically, how do we justify it to people who only care about the bottom line?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
